smoothCanonicalCurveGenus15 -- Computes the ideal of canonical curve of genus 15
********************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        smoothCanonicalCurveGenus15(p)
  * Inputs:
      * p, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the characteristic
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
