        is "false".
  * Outputs:
      * ICan, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, the ideal of a (smooth)
        canonical curve of genus g over a field with characteristic p

Description
===========

Computes a smooth canonical curve of genus g over a field of characteristc p.
The construction uses matrixfactorizations and we catch the steps which do not
work out for very small characteristic. The whole construction is based on the
Macaulay2 package "MatFac15"

If the option Printing is set to true then printings about the current step in
the construction are displayed.

